---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: About
description: DFWin International was established in 2012 by supply chain professionals to provide end-to-end supply for North American and European buyers.
permalink: about.html
css: about
ctaTitle: Talk to the team that would run your order.
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Supply chain veterans, close to the source</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ site.name }} was founded by veteran supply chain professionals to serve North American and European customers from close to the supply base in Asia.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="on-light band">
<div class="wrap">
  <figure class="media ab-photo">
    <img src="{{ 'assets/img/hero-ship.webp' | rel }}" alt="Cruise ship under way on a calm sea" width="2400" height="1350" decoding="async">
  </figure>
</div>

<section class="ab-body">
  <div class="wrap ab-split">
    <div>
      <h2 class="visually-hidden" id="mission-title">Our mission</h2>
      <ul class="ab-mission" aria-labelledby="mission-title">
        <li>To serve as a trusted, long-term strategic partner.</li>
        <li>To empower clients through successful, large-scale supply chain transformations.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <dl class="ab-facts">
      <div><dt>Established</dt><dd>{{ site.founded }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Supplying cruise lines since</dt><dd>2014</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Offices</dt><dd>{% for office in site.offices %}<span>{{ office.city }}</span>{% endfor %}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Sales</dt><dd><a href="mailto:{{ site.email.sales }}">{{ site.email.sales }}</a></dd></div>
      <div><dt>General</dt><dd><a href="mailto:{{ site.email.general }}">{{ site.email.general }}</a></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>
</div>
